### POST request update a file using prevFile
POST http://localhost:8080/api/upload?prevFile=SubPluginExemple.jar
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary
Accept: application/json

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="SubPluginExemple.jar"
Content-Type: application/java-archive

< ./SubPluginExemple.jar
--WebAppBoundary--

### return
